# A delayed watch created on turn one expires before Memnite attacks on turn three (CR 603.7b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Delif's Cone
Memnite
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Delif's Cone.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Delif's Cone.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Delif's Cone
